Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why would road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:01.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,crews park a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:01.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,truck right in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,your lane?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:03.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:04.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,parked on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:05.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,between traffic and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.81,0:00:06.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,the workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:07.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,On its back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:08.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,is a crash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.16,0:00:08.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,cushion that folds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:09.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,down like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:09.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,a tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:11.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Inside are blocks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:11.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,of thin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:12.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,aluminum honeycomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.91,0:00:13.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.48,0:00:14.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits, the honeycomb
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:15.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,crushes row
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:15.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,by row.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:16.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:17.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,slows down over
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:18.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,about eight feet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,of crushing metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:20.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,The truck is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,heavy and braked,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:22.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,so it only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:22.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,rolls a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:23.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,few feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's built to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:25.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop\Na five-thousand-pound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:26.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,pickup at sixty-two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:28.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,In one state,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:29.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,drivers hit thirty-nine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:30.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,of them in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,under eight months.
